        "content": "## Scope and triage\n\nThis dashboard shows aggregate critical findings from completed Harbor image scans. It intentionally excludes artifact names, digests, and individual CVE IDs. Use Harbor to identify and remediate the affected image, then roll out the rebuilt image through GitOps.\n\nA missing collector series is a monitoring failure, not a clean scan result. The companion critical alert treats absent data and evaluation errors as alerting.",
